{#
  Manual targeted deletes for stale config nodes.

  Add a `delete ...` line here whenever a node needs to be removed from the
  router that the set-command partials won't naturally overwrite.

  Important:
  This file is loaded through `vyos_config` as raw commands. The first
  non-empty line must be a `delete ...` command. Do not put comments or blank
  lines before the first delete, or the parser will misread the file and fail
  with a `set delete ...` error.
#}
